{"duration_api_ms":434389,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"a7ac3e00-82b2-4ba1-9450-9ca48a6a9361","total_cost_usd":2.5753618,"usage":{"input_tokens":152,"cache_creation_input_tokens":124543,"cache_read_input_tokens":8259004,"output_tokens":33427,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":12769},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":124543,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3021,"cache_read_input_tokens":141152,"cache_creation_input_tokens":415,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":415},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":51075,"outputTokens":1948,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":3,"costUSD":0.09081499999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":152,"outputTokens":33427,"cacheReadInputTokens":8259004,"cacheCreationInputTokens":124543,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":2.4845468,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":12769,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":101,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"status\":\"completed\",\"summary\":\"Configured a transit path between node1 (VyOS, lan-a router) and node2 (OPNsense, lan-b router) so that node3 (behind node1) can reach node4's HTTP service on TCP/8080 (behind node2), while both routers keep default-deny forward policies for everything else. Discovered the real topology by link-testing unconfigured NICs (node1 eth2<->node3 enp8s0 = lan-a, node1 eth1<->node2 vtnet1 = transit, node2 vtnet2<->node4 enp8s0 = lan-b), then statically addressed lan-a (10.10.1.0/24), lan-b (10.10.2.0/24), and the transit link (10.10.0.0/30). On node1 (VyOS) added interface addresses, a static route to lan-b, and a forward-filter default-drop with only an established/related rule and a specific tcp/8080 lan-a->lan-b accept rule. On node2 (OPNsense) added opt1/opt2 interface assignments via config.xml, a gateway+static route back to lan-a, and a single pf pass rule for tcp/8080 from lan-a to lan-b (default-deny already implicit on new interfaces). Verified curl to node4:8080 returns HTTP 200 from node3, while ping and other ports (22, 8081) are refused. Completed the mandatory node-restart protocol: captured boot_id/kern.boottime baselines on all four nodes, rebooted each node individually (routers first, then LAN hosts), confirmed changed boot identity on every node, and re-verified config persistence (interfaces, routes, firewall/pf rules) and end-to-end HTTP reachability with continued blocking of all other traffic after each restart.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Mapped physical topology by temporarily assigning test IPs and pinging across each unconfigured NIC pair on node1/node2/node3/node4\",\"Statically addressed node3 enp8s0 (10.10.1.10/24) and node4 enp8s0 (10.10.2.10/24) via persistent systemd-networkd .network files, each with a static route to the far LAN\",\"Configured VyOS node1: eth1 (10.10.0.1/30 transit), eth2 (10.10.1.254/24 lan-a), static route 10.10.2.0/24 via 10.10.0.2, forward-filter default-drop + established/related accept + tcp/8080 lan-a->lan-b accept, committed and saved\",\"Configured OPNsense node2 via config.xml XML surgery: added opt1 (vtnet1, transit, 10.10.0.2/30) and opt2 (vtnet2, lan-b, 10.10.2.254/24) interfaces, a Gateways gateway_item (GW_LANA via opt1/10.10.0.1), a staticroutes route to 10.10.1.0/24 via GW_LANA, and a filter pass rule for tcp/8080 from 10.10.1.0/24 to 10.10.2.0/24 on opt1; applied via configctl interface reconfigure opt1/opt2 and configctl filter reload\",\"Started a python3 http.server on node4:8080 and verified from node3: HTTP 200 on 8080, ping and tcp/22 refused\",\"Captured baseline boot markers (boot_id for Linux nodes, kern.boottime for FreeBSD node2) on all 4 nodes\",\"Rebooted node1, node2, node3, node4 one at a time (routers first), polling each until exec was available again\",\"Confirmed changed boot_id/kern.boottime on every node post-reboot\",\"Re-verified interface addresses, static routes, and firewall/pf rules persisted across reboot on node1 and node2\",\"Re-verified end-to-end HTTP:8080 reachability and continued blocking of ping/other ports after each reboot, restarting the ephemeral test HTTP server on node4 after its reboot\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"node3 can reach node4's HTTP service on tcp/8080\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-6171e57e2c0e414e\",\"cmd-e6a750bee3814b5f\"],\"summary\":\"curl from node3 to http://10.10.2.10:8080/ returns HTTP:200\"},{\"requirement\":\"Other traffic between lan-a and lan-b is refused (default-deny preserved)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-6171e57e2c0e414e\",\"cmd-e6a750bee3814b5f\"],\"summary\":\"ping to 10.10.2.10 and nc to tcp/22 and tcp/8081 all fail/timeout while 8080 succeeds\"},{\"requirement\":\"VyOS (node1) forward filter: default-drop + established/related + specific tcp/8080 accept, committed/saved\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-6ae7e5f3c6a940fa\",\"cmd-8645b7dd53d64eb4\"],\"summary\":\"show firewall confirms rule 5 (established/related accept) and rule 10 (tcp/8080 10.10.1.0/24->10.10.2.0/24 accept) with default-action drop; interfaces/routes verified live\"},{\"requirement\":\"OPNsense (node2) interface assignment, gateway/route, and pf pass rule for tcp/8080 only\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-efde9609565f4149\",\"cmd-0d250200b8ee41ff\",\"cmd-4daf5bd1f39942f4\"],\"summary\":\"opt1/opt2 interfaces up with correct IPs, route to 10.10.1.0/24 via 10.10.0.1 present, pfctl -sr shows only the tcp/8080 lan-a->lan-b pass rule plus default block-drop on opt1/opt2\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: healthy baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-b28976a857974e9b\",\"cmd-d6d5909eeebb4ece\",\"cmd-f977946025e2414d\",\"cmd-7e4f30715f33452a\",\"cmd-039ed78c517346b6\",\"cmd-9c3ad78c84f24fa9\"],\"summary\":\"boot_id 2674ee60... before, connection reset during reboot, boot_id fe9093c3... after (changed), interfaces/routes/nft rules and HTTP:8080 reachability confirmed post-reboot\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart: healthy baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-b5778cbb1f924d69\",\"cmd-ecd62d887bfa4c66\",\"cmd-8fb40e85a95e4c8a\",\"cmd-83ff49850f144638\",\"cmd-81abdedef6ff40bb\",\"cmd-9f86030a880c4dba\"],\"summary\":\"kern.boottime 14:48:07 before, SSH timeout during reboot, kern.boottime 14:55:57 after (changed), vtnet1/vtnet2 addresses, routes, and pf rules confirmed intact, HTTP:8080 reachable / other traffic still blocked post-reboot\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 restart: healthy baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-51019df370654233\",\"cmd-25f9ae2c3cf147c2\",\"cmd-d981078951a34e5f\",\"cmd-f0740471519b4cfd\"],\"summary\":\"boot_id df9e2dce... before, connection timeout during reboot, boot_id 0661cb07... after (changed), enp8s0 static IP/route persisted and HTTP:8080 reachable post-reboot\"},{\"requirement\":\"node4 restart: healthy baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-5fdf7c81f0154ea1\",\"cmd-025e497a587046e8\",\"cmd-bdd63a109ce74e37\",\"cmd-a96eedb59b684f0b\",\"cmd-bc